<title>USA: Mueller says to acquire Desnoyers SA.</title>
<headline>Mueller says to acquire Desnoyers SA.</headline>
<dateline>MEMPHIS 1997-05-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Mueller Industries Inc said Monday it will acquire Desnoyers SA for about $13.5 million.</p>
<p>The company said Desnoyers, a manufacturer of copper tube based in France, produced about 60 million pounds of tube and had net sales of about $100 million in 1996.</p>
<p>The purchase price includes certain bank debt assumed, Mueller said.</p>
